{
"k": "6294",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Where did you go… after?"
},
{
"k": "6295",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "And that's it? You didn't see that girl again?"
},
{
"k": "6296",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "No. [Confused] Crawled out the dumpster… Came straight here. Why? What'd she say?"
},
{
"k": "6297",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Where'd you go after you crawled out of that dumpster? Tell it to me straight."
},
{
"k": "6298",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Came here. Patched myself up best I could. I won't lie… I've had a couple… for the pain, you know?"
},
{
"k": "6299",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "I'm not. I assumed you had it. Evidence or somethin'. You tellin' me you don't got it ?"
},
{
"k": "6300",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Where's your axe?"
},
{
"k": "6301",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "You don't have it?"
},
{
"k": "6302",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Don't give me that shit-"
},
{
"k": "6303",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Why did you kill Faith?"
},
{
"k": "6304",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Why did you kill her?"
},
{
"k": "6305",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Kill who?"
},
{
"k": "6306",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "It doesn't look good when a girl you were just smackin' around shows up dead hours later."
},
{
"k": "6307",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "The girl you were beatin' on this morning."
},
{
"k": "6308",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "No. No. No. No. I was here. I swear."
},
{
"k": "6309",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "And now you don't know where your axe is? Doesn't look good."
},
{
"k": "6310",
"who": "GREN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "He was here."
},
{
"k": "6311",
"who": "GREN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "That's the fuckin' truth, Sheriff."
},
{
"k": "6312",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "[still crying] You see? Bigby please. You can't. They'll throw me down the Witching Well. That's what they'll do and I didn't do it. You know that."
},
{
"k": "6313",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "She's dead? [sobs] Bigby listen... I'm a piece of shit, okay... I know that. I hit that girl. I did. I shouldn't've but... I didn't kill her. You believe me, right?"
},
{
"k": "6314",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Enough"
},
{
"k": "6315",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Enough. I've heard about all I can stand."
},
{
"k": "6316",
"who": "GREN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "[loud, intense] Shut the fuck up, Woody. Shit ain't just about you. It's about this fuckin' lap dog. Only comes sniffing around this part of town when the rich fucks in the Woodlands need a shakedown. Ain't that right, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "6317",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Lap dog? Really?"
},
{
"k": "6318",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "It's not like that."
},
{
"k": "6319",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "It's not like that. There are problems with the way things go, I get it. But that's got nothing to do with what's happening right now."
},
{
"k": "6320",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "You're backing the wrong guy."
},
{
"k": "6321",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "You're backing the wrong guy. If you saw what I saw last night, you'd know that."
},
{
"k": "6322",
"who": "GREN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Holly's sister goes missing and no one gives two shits about her. Paperwork, waiting rooms, and that bitch Snow White looking right past me, then ushering me out the fuckin' door."
},
{
"k": "6323",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Don't call her that."
},
{
"k": "6324",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "I wouldn't call her that. It's happened before and it doesn't end well."
},
{
"k": "6325",
"who": "GREN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "I didn't realize you were the bitch of the bitch."
},
{
"k": "6326",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_trollbar",
"en": "Big mouth"
},
{
"k": "6327",
"who": "BIGBY",
